    "description": "Synthetic element for testing parametric products (spec §5.8). A solid mass plywood wall panel cut to size within the manufacturer's limits, at one fixed thickness. The thickness and billet limits follow a five-layer mass plywood layup listed in the public evaluation report ICC-ES ESR-4760; the manufacturer, interface, rules, density, lift capacities and price are invented. It is not a manufacturer's product declaration and carries no engineering, fabrication, commercial or certification claim.",
    "notes": "Rectangular cuts only. Openings are not parameters in this example."
  },
